 \noindent\textbf{Contributions.}
 \textbf{(C1)} A per-DOF grey-box FOPDT identification methodology for an omnidirectional robot from \emph{closed-loop} competition logs, validated on held-out events, for the degrees of freedom those logs excite. 
 \textbf{(C2)} A fidelity protocol that scores the model the way it is used: driven only by the recorded commands from a known pose, with no correction from measured data inside the window. Verdicts are issued per motion regime and only when a paired test, an effect size, and a bootstrap interval agree.
